{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'll work through this step-by-step. Let me start by identifying the key elements:\n\n1. A book (Book A) that was a contender for an award\n2. The award itself was originally created in the 2000s\n3. Book A was translated into over 25 languages\n4. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won the award\n5. Book B had been released the preceding year\n6. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up\n7. Question: In what city was the author of Book A born?\n\nLet me search for awards created in the 2000s that are known for books translated into many languages.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created 2000s translated over twenty five languages\", \"book award founded 2000s international translated many languages\", \"novel translated 25 languages award contender 2010s\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_ea8cd797c1f048dbb9e99ecc","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789472892,"id":"chatcmpl-d114e1a3-4c65-9491-ab2e-2acdf2104c6d","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":208,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4078,"cached_tokens":3840,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3840},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}